"The breeder is the pit lord Elasar, who may hold a master ring able to override every creature."
"Baron Samell Toth feeds his creature villagers lured to his castle with gifts and private meetings."
"Toth's steward Marley wears the creature's ring and urges feeding it children; Toth forbids it."
"Toth's ring seems defective, and his creature may be slipping its control."
